  ('Caller', 'US', "We're not students, so two full-price tickets, please. Where does the tour start?"),
  ('Assistant', 'GB', "It starts outside the main entrance of the Central Library, on Queen's Square. Martin will be wearing a green jacket with our logo on the back. Please arrive ten minutes early, because the tour leaves on time."),
