  ('Caller', 'US', "That should be fine. What happens if it rains?"),
  ('Assistant', 'GB', "The tour goes ahead in all weather, except storms. Part of the route is indoors, in the library and the concert hall, but you'll still need a raincoat or an umbrella. If we have to cancel because of severe weather, we'll send you a text message by eight o'clock that morning and give you a full refund."),
